; A module that declares an effect, for `830-effect-import.ax`.
;
; It sits BESIDE its case rather than in a subdirectory, because a
; module's name is its filename stem and stage1 searches the entry
; file's own directory first - and because the diagnostics sweep reads
; every file in this tree from its real path, where a case whose
; import cannot resolve is a hard failure rather than a silence.
; `check-self-host.sh` tells the two apart by name: a case is
; digit-prefixed and must declare `; expect N`, anything else is a
; module.
(pub effect Ask
  (ask :: (-> Int Int)))
